ntext-ibo-history-heading\">IBO fiscal history</h3><div class=\"agency-fiscal-context-table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"IBO measures by fiscal year\"><table class=\"agency-fiscal-context-table\"><caption>IBO measures by fiscal year</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">FY</th><th scope=\"col\">IBO actual expenditures</th><th scope=\"col\">IBO Personal Services</th><th scope=\"col\">IBO Other Than Personal Services</th><th scope=\"col\">IBO staffing</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">FY2013</th><td>$4,247,437</td><td>$3,911,447</td><td>$335,990</td><td>39</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FY2014</th><td>$4,161,593</td><td>$3,932,446</td><td>$229,147</td><td>36</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FY2015</th><td>$4,261,058</td><td>$4,035,473</td><td>$225,585</td><td>38</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FY2016</th><td>$4,258,745</td><td>$4,119,938</td><td>$138,807</td><td>38</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FY2017</th><td>$4,618,742</td><td>$4,486,764</td><td>$131,978</td><td>38</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FY2018</th><td>$4,819,336</td><td>$4,615,490</td><td>$203,846</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FY2019</th><td>$4,972,216</td><td>$4,879,967</td><td>$172,367</td><td>43</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FY2020</th><td>$5,455,984</td><td>$5,311,991</td><td>$143,993</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FY2021</th><td>$5,664,906</td><td>$5,511,097</td><td>$153,809</td><td>42</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FY2022</th><td>$5,938,225</td><td>$5,732,522</td><td>$205,703</td><td>44</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div><p class=\"agency-fiscal-context-status agency-fiscal-context-footnote\">Current snapshots cover IBO fiscal years FY1980–FY2022 and procurement/payment years Unknown. A dash means the publisher does not report that measure for that year.</p><p class=\"agency-fiscal-context-status\">Showing the latest ten IBO fiscal years plus every current procurement/payment year; the full IBO history remains in the materialized source.</p><div class=\"agency-fiscal-context-rankings\"><h3>Separate agency rankings</h3><table><caption>Separate reference rankings by measure</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Measure</th><th scope=\"col\">Reference</th><th scope=\"col\">Rank</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">IBO actual expenditures</th><td>FY2022</td><td>#41 of 55</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">IBO staffing measure</th><td>FY2022</td><td>#41 of 50</td></tr></tbody></table><p>These rankings are descriptive, not causal; they do not form a composite outsourcing or efficiency score or establish vendor reliance.</p></div><div class=\"agency-fiscal-context-provenance\"><h3>Sources and measure definitions</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://ns2.ibo.nyc.ny.us/fiscalhistory.html\">IBO New York City Fiscal History</a>: actual department expenditures in publisher $000s, shown here in USD; staffing is actual full-time positions reported as of June 30. Publisher vintage FY2022.</li><li><a href=\"https://a0333-passportpublic.nyc.gov/contracts.html\">PASSPort Public procurement records</a>: registered contract values and counts are a point-in-time snapshot of current registered value, not actual spending.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.checkbooknyc.com/\">Checkbook NYC</a>, the Comptroller's spending ledger: actual payment amounts and transaction counts, not registered contract values.</li></ul><p>These sources use different accounting scopes.</p></div></section><section class=\"node-section node-card civic-object-section\" data-export-class=\"object_members\" id=\"agency-statutory-mandates\" data-agency-constellation-category=\"obligations\" data-status=\"matched\" data-edge-state=\"matched\" data-edge-availability=\"available\" data-certification-basis=\"auto_certified_quote_verify_v1\"><h2>Mandates (2 mandates)</h2><p class=\"node-muted muted\">Mandates set by law, alongside public records that show a related filing when one is found.</p><ul class=\"node-record-list\"><li class=\"node-record\" data-obligation-id=\"6095